# OP3 Sensor Manager / SLPI transport experiment lock.
#
# This is deliberately separate from manifests/op3-recovery-audio-full.env:
# the sensor transport is an isolated kernel experiment and is not part of
# the accepted recovery image until an owner-run build and device test pass.

